      "round_num": 0,
      "action": "consistency_revision",
      "revised_slots": [
        "trigger",
        "postconditions"
      ],
      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "The Trigger places the start of the use case at the order-cancellation event and the generation of the automated offer email, but the Preconditions already state that the order is cancelled/on hold and that the offer email has already been triggered. The Preconditions therefore describe states that exist only after the Trigger has occurred, so the Trigger is not aligned with the upstream Preconditions and does not lead cleanly into the Customer action in Main Flow step 1.",
        "The Main Flow only reaches initiation of the payment process and automated order generation for the credit-card option. It never establishes that the credit card has been charged or that the item has been shipped, so the postcondition \"If the credit card option was used, the system has charged the credit card and shipped the item\" is not reachable from the success path."
      ]
    }
